            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Val Cameron"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I've made this easy, tasty recipe several times although I've tweaked it a bit to my personal taste. My husband and I love it, and I always make 2 batches for leftovers!",
            "datePublished": "2026-05-24T20:21:28.206Z"
