            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Butch"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I followed a couple of reveiws and decreased the olive oil to 2 tbs also added 1 tsp of onion powder. I followed the recommendations of turning the wings at 20 mins, then back in an additional 15 mins. Removed to place under broiler for 3 mins on each size. The wings were cooked to 170° on meat thermometer and absolutely juicy. Sprinkled Buffalo sauce and served",
